{"path":".agents/skills/improve-codebase-architecture/HTML-REPORT.md","ref":"1f305ea273a1133774b6a1eda851a5ad99278ad3","side":"old","lines":[{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":1,"text":"# HTML Report Format"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":2,"text":""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":3,"text":"The architectural review is rendered as a single self-contained HTML file in the OS temp directory. Tailwind and Mermaid both come from CDNs. Mermaid handles graph-shaped diagrams reliably; hand-built divs and inline SVG handle the more editorial visuals (mass diagrams, cross-sections). Mix the two — don't lean on Mermaid for everything, it'll start to look generic."},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":4,"text":""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":5,"text":"## Scaffold"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":6,"text":""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":7,"text":"```html"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":8,"text":"<!doctype html>"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":9,"text":"<html lang=\"en\">"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":10,"text":"  <head>"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":11,"text":"    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":12,"text":"    <title>Architecture review — {{repo name}}</title>"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":13,"text":"    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":14,"text":"    <script type=\"module\">"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":15,"text":"      import mermaid from \"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mermaid@11/dist/mermaid.esm.min.mjs\";"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":16,"text":"      mermaid.initialize({ startOnLoad: true, theme: \"neutral\", securityLevel: \"loose\" });"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":17,"text":"    </script>"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":18,"text":"    <style>"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":19,"text":"      /* small custom layer for things Tailwind doesn't cover cleanly:"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":20,"text":"         dashed seam lines, hand-drawn-feeling arrow heads, etc. */"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":21,"text":"      .seam { stroke-dasharray: 4 4; }"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":22,"text":"      .leak { stroke: #dc2626; }"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":23,"text":"      .deep { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a, #1e293b); }"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":24,"text":"    </style>"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":25,"text":"  </head>"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":26,"text":"  <body class=\"bg-stone-50 text-slate-900 font-sans\">"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":27,"text":"    <main class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 space-y-12\">"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":28,"text":"      <header>...</header>"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":29,"text":"      <section id=\"candidates\" class=\"space-y-10\">...</section>"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":30,"text":"      <section id=\"top-recommendation\">...</section>"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":31,"text":"    </main>"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":32,"text":"  </body>"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":33,"text":"</html>"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":34,"text":"```"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":35,"text":""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":36,"text":"## Header"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":37,"text":""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":38,"text":"Repo name, date, and a compact legend: solid box = module, dashed line = seam, red arrow = leakage, thick dark box = deep module. No introduction paragraph — straight into the candidates."},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":39,"text":""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":40,"text":"## Candidate card"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":41,"text":""},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":42,"text":"The diagrams carry the weight. Prose is sparse, plain, and uses the glossary terms (from the `/codebase-design` skill) without ceremony."},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":43,"text":""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":44,"text":"Each candidate is one `<article>`:"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":45,"text":""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":46,"text":"- **Title** — short, names the deepening (e.g. \"Collapse the Order intake pipeline\")."},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":47,"text":"- **Badge row** — recommendation strength (`Strong` = emerald, `Worth exploring` = amber, `Speculative` = slate), plus a tag for the dependency category (`in-process`, `local-substitutable`, `ports & adapters`, `mock`)."},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":48,"text":"- **Files** — monospaced list, `font-mono text-sm`."},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":49,"text":"- **Before / After diagram** — the centrepiece. Two columns, side by side. See patterns below."},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":50,"text":"- **Problem** — one sentence. What hurts."},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":51,"text":"- **Solution** — one sentence. What changes."},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":52,"text":"- **Wins** — bullets, ≤6 words each. e.g. \"Tests hit one interface\", \"Pricing logic stops leaking\", \"Delete 4 shallow wrappers\"."},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":53,"text":"- **ADR callout** (if applicable) — one line in an amber-tinted box."},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":54,"text":""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":55,"text":"No paragraphs of explanation. If the diagram needs a paragraph to be understood, redraw the diagram."},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":56,"text":""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":57,"text":"## Diagram patterns"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":58,"text":""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":59,"text":"Pick the pattern that fits the candidate. Mix them. Don't make every diagram look the same — variety is part of the point."},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":60,"text":""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":61,"text":"### Mermaid graph (the workhorse for dependencies / call flow)"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":62,"text":""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":63,"text":"Use a Mermaid `flowchart` or `graph` when the point is \"X calls Y calls Z, and look at the mess.\" Wrap it in a Tailwind-styled card so it doesn't feel parachuted in. Style with classDef to colour leakage edges red and the deep module dark. Sequence diagrams work well for \"before: 6 round-trips; after: 1.\""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":64,"text":""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":65,"text":"```html"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":66,"text":"<div class=\"rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4\">"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":67,"text":"  <pre class=\"mermaid\">"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":68,"text":"    flowchart LR"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":69,"text":"      A[OrderHandler] --> B[OrderValidator]"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":70,"text":"      B --> C[OrderRepo]"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":71,"text":"      C -.leak.-> D[PricingClient]"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":72,"text":"      classDef leak stroke:#dc2626,stroke-width:2px;"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":73,"text":"      class C,D leak"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":74,"text":"  </pre>"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":75,"text":"</div>"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":76,"text":"```"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":77,"text":""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":78,"text":"### Hand-built boxes-and-arrows (when Mermaid's layout fights you)"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":79,"text":""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":80,"text":"Modules as `<div>`s with borders and labels. Arrows as inline SVG `<line>` or `<path>` elements positioned absolutely over a relative container. Reach for this when you want the \"after\" diagram to feel like one thick-bordered deep module with greyed-out internals — Mermaid won't render that with the right weight."},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":81,"text":""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":82,"text":"### Cross-section (good for layered shallowness)"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":83,"text":""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":84,"text":"Stack horizontal bands (`h-12 border-l-4`) to show layers a call passes through. Before: 6 thin layers each doing nothing. After: 1 thick band labelled with the consolidated responsibility."},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":85,"text":""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":86,"text":"### Mass diagram (good for \"interface as wide as implementation\")"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":87,"text":""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":88,"text":"Two rectangles per module — one for interface surface area, one for implementation. Before: interface rectangle is nearly as tall as the implementation rectangle (shallow). After: interface rectangle is short, implementation rectangle is tall (deep)."},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":89,"text":""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":90,"text":"### Call-graph collapse"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":91,"text":""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":92,"text":"Before: a tree of function calls rendered as nested boxes. After: the same tree collapsed into one box, with the now-internal calls shown faded inside it."},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":93,"text":""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":94,"text":"## Style guidance"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":95,"text":""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":96,"text":"- Lean editorial, not corporate-dashboard. Generous whitespace. Serif optional for headings (`font-serif` works well with stone/slate)."},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":97,"text":"- Colour sparingly: one accent (emerald or indigo) plus red for leakage and amber for warnings."},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":98,"text":"- Keep diagrams ~320px tall so before/after sits comfortably side by side without scrolling."},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":99,"text":"- Use `text-xs uppercase tracking-wider` for module labels inside diagrams — they should read as schematic, not as UI."},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":100,"text":"- The only scripts are the Tailwind CDN and the Mermaid ESM import. The report is otherwise static — no app code, no interactivity beyond Mermaid's own rendering."},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":101,"text":""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":102,"text":"## Top recommendation section"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":103,"text":""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":104,"text":"One larger card. Candidate name, one sentence on why, anchor link to its card. That's it."},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":105,"text":""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":106,"text":"## Tone"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":107,"text":""},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":108,"text":"Plain English, concise — but the architectural nouns and verbs come straight from the `/codebase-design` skill. Concision is not an excuse to drift."},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":109,"text":""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":110,"text":"**Use exactly:** module, interface, implementation, depth, deep, shallow, seam, adapter, leverage, locality."},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":111,"text":""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":112,"text":"**Never substitute:** component, service, unit (for module) · API, signature (for interface) · boundary (for seam) · layer, wrapper (for module, when you mean module)."},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":113,"text":""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":114,"text":"**Phrasings that fit the style:**"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":115,"text":""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":116,"text":"- \"Order intake module is shallow — interface nearly matches the implementation.\""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":117,"text":"- \"Pricing leaks across the seam.\""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":118,"text":"- \"Deepen: one interface, one place to test.\""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":119,"text":"- \"Two adapters justify the seam: HTTP in prod, in-memory in tests.\""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":120,"text":""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":121,"text":"**Wins bullets** name the gain in glossary terms: *\"locality: bugs concentrate in one module\"*, *\"leverage: one interface, N call sites\"*, *\"interface shrinks; implementation absorbs the wrappers\"*. Don't write *\"easier to maintain\"* or *\"cleaner code\"* — those terms aren't in the glossary and don't earn their place."},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":122,"text":""},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":123,"text":"No hedging, no throat-clearing, no \"it's worth noting that…\". If a sentence could be a bullet, make it a bullet. If a bullet could be cut, cut it. If a term isn't in the `/codebase-design` glossary, reach for one that is before inventing a new one."}]}
